<title>MEXICO: La Moderna says director returns to work.</title>
<headline>La Moderna says director returns to work.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Director general of Mexican holding company Empresas La Moderna Alfonso Romo has returned to work after an urgent operation in Germany, the company said.</p>
<p>The former Olympic equestrian underwent an almost two-hour ankle operation after falling from a horse.</p>
<p>&quot;Mr. Romo is working as normal here in the office. He is doing very well and his life has returned to normal,&quot; company spokesman Jaime Garcia told Reuters.</p>
<p>((-- Jacqueline Lerma, Monterrey bureau, +528 345-7677))</p>
